famous for amazing ice cream concoctions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.560
but the to answer your question more specifically,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:28.346
I think by Serendipity you mean wonderful&nbsp;
things happening kind of out of the blue?

00:00:28.346 --> 00:00:28.920
